---
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |  Limit: skip=CAST(Int64(0) AS Int64), fetch=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   Sort: A.NumberSid ASC NULLS LAST, A.Capability ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |     Projection: A.DateCreated, A.DateUpdated, A.AccountSid, A.NumberPoolSid, A.NumberSid, A.MaxRate, A.NumberDid, A.NumberType, A.SupportedDestRegion, A.NumberRegion, A.CurrentRate, A.IsAvailable, A.ProviderSid, A.AreaCodeRegion, A.AvailableForNumberSelection, A.Capability                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       Filter: A.AccountSid = Utf8("AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066") AND A.NumberPoolSid = Utf8("NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9") AND A.NumberType IN ([Utf8("lc")]) AND A.MaxRate = CAST(Int64(20) AS Int64) AND A.NumberSid NOT IN ([Utf8("PN00000000000000000000000000000099")]) AND CASE WHEN CAST(Int64(0) AS Int64) THEN A.AvailableForNumberSelection = Int64(1) ELSE A.AvailableForNumberSelection IN ([Int64(1), Int64(0)]) END AND A.Capability = Utf8("sms")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |         SubqueryAlias: A                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           TableScan: number_info_with_cap projection=[DateCreated, DateUpdated, AccountSid, NumberPoolSid, NumberSid, MaxRate, NumberDid, NumberType, SupportedDestRegion, NumberRegion, CurrentRate, IsAvailable, ProviderSid, AreaCodeRegion, AvailableForNumberSelection, Capability]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=:memory: base_sql=SELECT "A"."DateCreated", "A"."DateUpdated", "A"."AccountSid", "A"."NumberPoolSid", "A"."NumberSid", "A"."MaxRate", "A"."NumberDid", "A"."NumberType", "A"."SupportedDestRegion", "A"."NumberRegion", "A"."CurrentRate", "A"."IsAvailable", "A"."ProviderSid", "A"."AreaCodeRegion", "A"."AvailableForNumberSelection", "A"."Capability" FROM "number_info_with_cap" AS "A" WHERE ((((((("A"."AccountSid" = 'AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066') AND ("A"."NumberPoolSid" = 'NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9')) AND "A"."NumberType" IN ('lc')) AND ("A"."MaxRate" = CAST(20 AS BIGINT))) AND "A"."NumberSid" NOT IN ('PN00000000000000000000000000000099')) AND CASE WHEN CAST(0 AS BIGINT) THEN ("A"."AvailableForNumberSelection" = 1) ELSE "A"."AvailableForNumberSelection" IN (1, 0) END) AND ("A"."Capability" = 'sms')) ORDER BY "A"."NumberSid" ASC NULLS LAST, "A"."Capability" ASC NULLS LAST LIMIT 1 OFFSET CAST(0 AS BIGINT) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
